        <div align="center">
            <strong>Recent News:</strong>      
        </div>
</div>
<div id="sidemid"> 
  <div align="left">
    <p>3/16/14: The Green MacHHHHine competed at the California State Championships!&nbsp; At the tournament, we seeded fourth out of 73 teams!&nbsp; We'll be heading to the World Championships in April!<br>
    <a href="State Championships 2014.jpg"><img src="State Championships 2014 Thumbnail.jpg" alt="" width="190" height="140"></a></p>
    <p>11/23/13: The Green MacHHHHine is back from our second competition of the season! At this competition in San Jose, we made it to the semifinals and won the Design Award! We now have two invitations to compete at the State Championships in March!<br>
    <a href="San Jose 2013.jpg"><img src="San Jose 2013 Thumbnail.jpg" width="190" height="140"></a></p>
    <p>11/1/13: The Green MacHHHHine introduces two new scoring programs!&nbsp; You can use these to quickly score Toss Up matches and skills challenges!&nbsp; (These cannot be used on touch devices - sorry!)<br>
      <a href="../scoring/index.html"><img src="Scoring Thumbnail.jpg" width="190" height="108"></a></p>
    <p>10/19/13: The Green MacHHHHine competed at a tournament in San Ramon. &nbsp;We seeded 11th out of 61 teams, made it to the quarterfinals, and won the tournament's Excellence Award!&nbsp; We've now been invited to compete at the State Championships in March!<br>
      <a href="San Ramon 2013 1.jpeg"><img src="San Ramon 2013 1 Thumbnail.jpg" width="190" height="159"></a></p>
    <br>
  </div>
</div>
      
      
